#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Manage your thread reply notifications"
msgstr "스레드 답글 알림 관리"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:7
msgid ""
"You're :doc:`notified </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"notifications>` in a :doc:`web browser </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-web-notifications>`, the :doc:`desktop app </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications>`, and on your "
":doc:`mobile device </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-"
"notifications>`, for threads you're following when you're @mentioned or "
"the messages contain a keyword you're tracking."
msgstr ""
"팔로우 중인 스레드에서 @멘션되거나 메시지에 추적 중인 키워드가 포함된 경우 "
":doc:`웹 브라우저 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-"
"notifications>`, :doc:`데스크톱 앱 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"desktop-notifications>`, :doc:`모바일 기기 </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-mobile-notifications>`\\ 에서 :doc:`알림 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications>`\\ 을 받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:11
msgid ""
"Mattermost auto-follows you on all direct and group messages, any thread "
"you start, as well as any thread where you've been :doc:`@mentioned "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>` directly."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 모든 개인 메시지와 그룹 메시지, 자신이 시작한 스레드, 그리고 직접 "
":doc:`@멘션 </end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>`\\ 된 스레드를 "
"자동으로 팔로우합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:12
msgid ""
"You can choose to :ref:`follow or unfollow any thread <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/organize-conversations:follow threads and messages>` at"
" any time."
msgstr ""
"언제든지 :ref:`스레드를 팔로우하거나 팔로우 해제 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/organize-conversations:follow threads and messages>`\\ 할 "
"수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:14
msgid ""
"You won't receive notifications for threads you're not following, or "
"thread replies when they don't @mention you directly. However, blue "
"message indicators show you unread thread replies you're not following in"
" a given public or private channel."
msgstr ""
"팔로우하지 않는 스레드나, 직접 @멘션하지 않은 스레드 답글에 대해서는 알림을 "
"받지 않습니다. 다만 파란색 메시지 표시는 특정 공개 채널이나 비공개 채널에서 "
"팔로우하지 않는 읽지 않은 스레드 답글을 알려 줍니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:16
msgid ""
"For all other messages, a channel appears bolded to indicate unread "
"messages."
msgstr "그 밖의 모든 메시지의 경우 채널이 굵게 표시되어 읽지 않은 메시지를 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:19
msgid "Customize your notifications"
msgstr "알림 사용자 지정"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:22
msgid "Follow all threads in channels automatically"
msgstr "채널의 모든 스레드 자동 팔로우"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:24
msgid ""
"You can follow all threads in a channel automatically by going to "
"**Channel Settings > Notification Preferences > Follow all threads in "
"this channel and enable the Automatically follow threads in this "
"channel**."
msgstr ""
"**Channel Settings > Notification Preferences > Follow all threads in this "
"channel and enable the Automatically follow threads in this channel**\\ 로 "
"이동하면 채널의 모든 스레드를 자동으로 팔로우할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:27
msgid "Get notified when threaded discussions are disabled"
msgstr "스레드 토론이 비활성화된 경우 알림 받기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:29
msgid ""
"If your organization doesn't use threaded discussions, or you have "
":ref:`opted out of threaded discussions <end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-display-options:threaded discussions>`, you can configure "
"Mattermost to notify you when someone replies to a thread you started, or"
" have participated in. Go to **Settings > Notifications > Reply "
"notifications** to choose one of 3 options:"
msgstr ""
"조직이 스레드 토론을 사용하지 않거나 :ref:`스레드 토론을 사용하지 않도록 설정 "
"<end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options:threaded "
"discussions>`\\ 한 경우, 자신이 시작했거나 참여한 스레드에 누군가가 답글을 "
"달면 알림을 받도록 OKR.BEST를 구성할 수 있습니다. **설정 > 알림 > Reply "
"notifications**\\ 로 이동해 3가지 옵션 중 하나를 선택하세요:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:31
msgid ""
"Receive notifications for messages in reply threads that you either start"
" or participate in."
msgstr "자신이 시작하거나 참여한 답글 스레드의 메시지에 대해 알림을 받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:32
msgid "Receive notifications on messages, but only in threads that you start."
msgstr "메시지에 대해 알림을 받되, 자신이 시작한 스레드에서만 받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:33
msgid ""
"Don't receive notifications on messages in reply threads unless you're "
"directly @mentioned."
msgstr "직접 @멘션되지 않는 한 답글 스레드의 메시지에 대해 알림을 받지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:36
msgid "Send automatic replies to direct messages"
msgstr "개인 메시지에 자동 답장 보내기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:38
msgid ""
"Want to automatically reply to direct messages when you're out of office?"
" When your system admin :ref:`enables the ability for you to do so "
"<administration-guide/configure/experimental-configuration-"
"settings:enable automatic replies>`, you can configure Mattermost to send"
" custom replies to direct messages by going to **Settings > Notifications"
" > Automatic Direct Message Replies**, selecting **Enable**, and "
"composing your automatic reply message."
msgstr ""
"부재 중일 때 개인 메시지에 자동으로 답장하고 싶으신가요? 시스템 관리자가 "
":ref:`이 기능 사용을 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/experimental-"
"configuration-settings:enable automatic replies>`\\ 하면, **설정 > 알림 > "
"Automatic Direct Message Replies**\\ 로 이동해 **Enable**\\ 을 선택하고 자동 "
"답장 메시지를 작성하여 개인 메시지에 사용자 지정 답장을 보내도록 OKR.BEST를 "
"구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:41
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:44
msgid "Are thread notification counts the same across all Mattermost clients?"
msgstr "스레드 알림 개수는 모든 OKR.BEST 클라이언트에서 동일한가요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:46
msgid ""
"No. Mobile app notifications only indicate unread threads with @mentions,"
" and not general unread activity."
msgstr ""
"아니요. 모바일 앱 알림은 @멘션이 있는 읽지 않은 스레드만 나타내며 일반적인 읽지 "
"않은 활동은 나타내지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications.rst:48
msgid ""
"Using Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app, the **Threads** "
"list bolds unread threads that don't contain @mentions."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용할 때, **Threads** 목록은 @멘션이 "
"없는 읽지 않은 스레드를 굵게 표시합니다."

